# The trial of pod-session in podssh, at its main after the take of pod-quic,
# after the patch of pod-wormhole (pod-session.needs): podssh-relay's
# src/session/ is glue over pod-session
# (podssh's sink of the budget's lines with its words, and podssh's own
# Movable, which the pipe of e2e/hold takes); src/udp/, src/answer.rs and
# src/transit/link.rs are re-exports. Each keeper takes the sink; the flows
# of UDP take podssh's resolver; podssh-cli keeps PODSSH_REPLAY_BUFFER. The
# tests of the layer and their plants leave podssh (pod-session's); the
# handover test with the channel, the close table and the role's resume
# stay. Each podcrates tag moves to the tag of the hand-off. The record
# with its citations, the repository checks; the builds of the default
# features and of the release's features; the checks of the features of
# the gate; clippy with the lints that the gate allows, with each feature of
# podssh-relay; the tests of podssh-relay, podssh-cli and podssh-iroh that
# run the layer, a far end's keeper, its budget, a handover, UDP in a
# stream or the transit link; rustfmt of the crates that the patch changes;
# each Rust toolchain of the workflows and build images against the
# rust-version of podcrates; each test target that the gate names; the
# binary of the release's features for x86_64 musl, built with zig (a debug
# build: the release profile takes LTO), and podssh's static check of it.
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- remap Cargo.lock > /dev/null
cargo run -q -p podssh-todo -- check
python3 scripts/check-repo.py
cargo build -q
cargo check -q -p podssh-ws -p podssh-relay -p podssh-core -p podssh-probe -p podssh-warp --features podssh-relay/blocking,podssh-relay/quick,podssh-relay/quic,podssh-relay/derp,podssh-relay/piping,podssh-relay/opentunnel,podssh-relay/code,podssh-relay/warp
cargo build -q -p podssh-cli --features iroh,warp
cargo clippy -q --all-targets -p podssh-ws -p podssh-relay -p podssh-cli -p podssh-iroh -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo clippy -q --all-targets -p podssh-relay --all-features -- -D warnings -A clippy::collapsible_if
cargo test -q -p podssh-relay --all-features --lib --test session_handover --test session_policy --test session_relay_resume --test reverse_layered --test relay_serve_reverse_cap --test relay_serve_once --test relay_serve_spares --test reverse_node --test reverse_operator --test reverse_restart --test reverse_window --test e2e_layered --test transit --test derp_link --test opentunnel_link --test piping --test croc
cargo test -q -p podssh-cli --lib --test node_moves --test node_window --test pipe_udp --test operator --test node
cargo test -q -p podssh-iroh --lib
cargo fmt -p podssh-relay -p podssh-cli -p podssh-iroh --check
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-toolchains.py"
python3 -I "$PODCRATES/scripts/check-consumer-tests.py"
cargo zigbuild -q --target x86_64-unknown-linux-musl -p podssh-cli --bin podssh --features "$(sed -n 's/^  RELEASE_FEATURES: //p' .github/workflows/release.yml)"
sh scripts/check-static.sh "${CARGO_TARGET_DIR:-target}/x86_64-unknown-linux-musl/debug/podssh"
